          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We are delighted to announce that Professor David Taylor, well-known to so many from his time as Director of AKU-ISMC, has been awarded the title of Emeritus Professor at AKU-ISMC. Responding to the honour, Professor Taylor said;  'I'm honoured by this award and delighted to be able to maintain my links with AKU and with ISMC in particular. They have meant a lot to me over the last almost twenty years.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
